[[Romanian Democratic Convention]] (CDR) members included the [[Christian Democratic National Peasants' Party|PNȚCD]], [[National Liberal Party (Romania)|PNL]], [[:ro:Partidul Național Liberal-Convenția Democrată|PNL–CD]] (1 senator), [[:ro:Uniunea Forțelor de Dreapta|PAR]] (3 senators), [[Ecologist Party of Romania|PER]] (1 senator), [[Green Party (Romania)|Ecologist Federation of Romania (FER)]] (1 senator).

